Package: passport
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Robin Boers <robin@dupunkto.org>
Depends: bash, arg, shellutils, gnupg, git, qrencode, openssh-client
Suggests: sec
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Hand a password store over to a phone through a looping QR code
 Bundles a sec or pass store's remote, SSH key and GPG keys into a looping
 QR code for the Passwords app to scan.
